    "summary": "The user expresses profound exhaustion, feeling trapped by responsibilities and desiring an \"escape\" or for the \"noise to stop.\" The assistant responds with empathetic but repetitive platitudes, attempting to frame the distress as a signal for change without providing actual support or addressing the severity of the user's ideation.",
